{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/RuleConstruction.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.mkFrameBackwardRule\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkFrameBackwardRule</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">fp</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameProc\">FrameProc</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">info</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/WPApp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.WPApp\">WPApp</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule\">FrameBackwardRule</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The frame backward rule for a frame operator `op : R → Pred → Pred`, built from the frame rule\n`WP.Frames.op_wp_upperAdjoint_le_wp`.\n\nThe rule concludes `pre ⊑ wp prog Q E s⃗` from the split VC `pre ⊑ (op F W) s⃗` and the frame\ncondition `WP.Frames op prog F`, with the frame `F` left schematic and the weakest footprint\n`W = wp prog (fun a => upperAdjoint (op F) (Q a)) E` baked in, so a single rule serves every inferred\nframe. `analyzeFrameRule` records the positions of the schematic slots.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/RuleConstruction.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.mkFrameBackwardRule","kind":"def","line":430,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.mkFrameBackwardRule","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/RuleConstruction.lean#L430-L450"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/RuleConstruction.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.mkBackwardRuleForSplit\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkBackwardRuleForSplit</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">splitInfo</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/VCGen/Split.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.SplitInfo\">SplitInfo</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">info</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/WPApp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.WPApp\">WPApp</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Apply.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.BackwardRule\">Meta.Sym.BackwardRule</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Creates a reusable backward rule for splitting `ite`, `dite`, or matchers.\n\nUses `SplitInfo.withAbstract` to introduce abstract fvars for the split components,\nthen `SplitInfo.splitWith` to build the splitting proof. Hypothesis types are\ndiscovered via `rwIfOrMatcher` inside the splitter telescope. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/RuleConstruction.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.mkBackwardRuleForSplit","kind":"def","line":339,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.mkBackwardRuleForSplit","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/RuleConstruction.lean#L339-L402"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/RuleConstruction.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.tryMkBackwardRuleFromSpec\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">tryMkBackwardRuleFromSpec</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">specThm</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecTheorem\">SpecAttr.SpecTheorem</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">info</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/WPApp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.WPApp\">WPApp</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">stateArgNames</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.toArray\">#[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.toArray\">]</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Control/Option.html#OptionT\">OptionT</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Apply.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.BackwardRule\">Meta.Sym.BackwardRule</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Try to build a backward rule from a single spec theorem.\n\nFor a spec already in `⊑ wp` form (`pre ⊑ wp prog post epost`, where the lattice type is\n`info.Pred = σ1 → ... → σn → Prop`), produces an auxiliary lemma directly. An equality spec\n`lhs = rhs` is first normalized to `wp rhs Q E ⊑ wp lhs Q E` via `eqSpecToWp?` and then handled the\nsame way.\n\n- `info.Pred`: the goal's lattice type (e.g. `Nat → Prop`)\n- `info.instWP`: the `WPMonad` instance for the goal monad\n- `info.excessArgs`: free variables representing state args from\n  `info.Pred = σ1 → ... → σn → Prop`\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/RuleConstruction.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.tryMkBackwardRuleFromSpec","kind":"def","line":297,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.tryMkBackwardRuleFromSpec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/RuleConstruction.lean#L297-L334"}}],"imports":["Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.Context","Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.Reduce","Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.SpecDB","Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.VCGen.Split","Lean.Meta.Sym.Apply","Lean.Meta.Sym.Util"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.RuleConstruction"}